ttPd3UkYBcVHmyA5RwM51cvPCIIQ-Z7LeBHHJoa0Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLPrIJAFmb2eWMHxdAllVK8onVNEW1fXzRJZelJafKMVg&oe=6AA161F8"}, {"file_name": "5SCREEN.png", "id": "4256794437966529", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824328_4256794444633195_5422379702880820592_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=orf02I_f8xYQ7kNvwH8oB1i&_nc_oc=AdqMvlYJUF_9UnXTOrSduXsaczQxuZOd4KaoLrGgp9KjH6oymlrGS0XYrsv4plCwcc4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLR6srukHsxmOXu8v_jY6QIIpNIg2ID2HOYM_SHkZS2Tg&oe=6AA14E75"}, {"file_name": "4SCREEN.png", "id": "1543588280580432", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823949_1543588283913765_3644671751113485474_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qEdIaqJycq0Q7kNvwEF1KCK&_nc_oc=Adr5XFLpa5z4g37C0MkyR6NTQkYPTB0Lop7HrqOafoNgm1AilVjXs3hU6UYngxNKNH8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIiW-MbfgyR6NIUizhf9zZns-aUNXprHh663Cbl91-YLw&oe=6AA16108"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Mecca: Chameleon Props Hunter", "keywords": ["mecha", "prop", "hunt", "chameleon", "meccha"], "long_description": "\ud83e\udd16 Welcome to Mecca: Chameleon Props Hunter, a thrilling prop hunt experience that puts your observation skills to the test. Inspired by the classic hide-and-seek game mode, every level is filled with cleverly hidden props waiting to be discovered.\n\n\ud83d\udd0d As the hunter, your mission is simple: search every room, inspect every object, and uncover disguised Mecca Chameleons before the timer expires and turn into a Meccha. If you don't find them in time, the props will turn into the mecca chameleon. What looks like an ordinary \ud83e\ude91 chair, \ud83d\udca1 lamp, or \u2615 coffee mug could be hiding in plain sight.\n\n\ud83e\udde0 Each map is designed to challenge your attention to detail with realistic environments, clever hiding spots (like a super chameleons) and increasingly difficult prop placements. Stay alert, think like a detective, and don't let the Prop super chameleon fool you.\n\n\u2728 Features\n\n\ud83c\udfaf Hunt hidden props in a unique prop hunt game mode.\n\n\ud83d\ude48 Inspired by classic hide-and-seek gameplay.\n\n\ud83c\udfe0 Explore detailed environments filled with clever disguises.\n\n\ud83d\udcc8 Increasingly challenging levels with new hiding spots.\n\n\ud83c\udfae Simple controls that are easy to learn but rewarding to master.\n\n\ud83d\udd0a Atmospheric sound effects and satisfying prop discoveries.\n\n\ud83e\udde9 Perfect for players who enjoy puzzle, stealth, and observation games.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 Can you find every hidden prop? Sharpen your eyes, trust your instincts, and prove you have what it takes to complete Mecca: Chameleon Props Hunter, the ultimate prop hunt adventure! \ud83d\udc41\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udde8\ufe0f", "short_description": "Mecca: Chameleon Props Hunter is a first-person Prop Hunt adventure where you play as a skilled Prop Hunter tracking mysterious capable of disguising themselves as everyday objects. Explore colorful environments, search for subtle clues, and uncover cleverly hidden super chameleons that blend seamlessly into the world. Some use paint, others hide in plain sight, and only the most observant hunters will find them all. Inspired by the thrill of Scribble Hunt.. Are you ready to be the hunter?"}]}, "developer_name": "MB Game Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mbgamestudio.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MB Game Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mbgamestudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type